@kampfverlag_agitation
title: Radicalizing the SA
subtitle: Use our printing presses to influence and radicalize the SA into adopting a more "strasserist" stance.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
